  "historyNote": "(See Revision Notes at Chapter Heading Saf-C 3200) #8915, eff 6-22-07; ss by #10189, eff 9-27-12 New. #10886, INTERIM, eff 7-16-15, EXPIRES: 1-12-16; ss by #11016, eff 1-6-16",
  "inScheme": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/scheme",
